# Keep the build context small.
#
# `bridge/` holds ~75 MB, of which ~73 MB is reverse-engineering material in
# local_recon/ (a 48 MB device sysroot and the 22 MB meiju binary). The image
# needs exactly ONE file out of that folder: the ARM msgtool.
#
# Note the form used below: exclude the *contents* of local_recon (local_recon/*)
# rather than the folder itself, then re-include msgtool. Excluding the folder
# outright would stop Docker descending into it and the negation would silently
# fail.

.git
.github
.claude
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.log
.env

# Reverse-engineering material — keep only msgtool.
local_recon/*
!local_recon/msgtool
tools

# Documentation and notes: not needed at runtime.
*.md

# v2 cloud bridge files — not part of the local image.
moovair2mqtt.py
moovair2mqttbeta.py
requirements.txt
Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
control.py
read_state.py
fcm_listen.py
test_auth.py
test_json_api.py
